    "title": "Silsbee mother jailed for child's school absences - NewsBreak",
    "text": "KFDM-TV\nwebsite\nSilsbee\nSilsbee mother jailed for child's school absences\nBy Taylor Justice,\n5 hours agoHardin County — A Silsbee mother, Christina Garcia, 36, was released from jail after being charged with violating Texas's compulsory attendance law. Garcia was accused of contributing to her child's non-attendance at school. According to the clerk in Judge Chris Ingram's court, Garcia pled to a violation and arranged to make payments but failed to follow through. Her failure to appear in court led to her arrest on Monday, and she also had five outstanding traffic tickets.\n5",
